experiment.prespecified:
Fixed 2026-11-19, before any zoo result was read (borg-reborn-rs#587, #591). Pilot (RULES 16); larger tiers only
after this gate and the owner. ctl is the shipped configuration, where nothing holds a flight's Recall back and the
danger setting cannot fire. The danger arms compare against their gate's own 0 arm: g2d* against g2, r0d100 against r0.
Gate:
- no config_error; one binary; each arm's three values in borg.txt and in params-core.json of the death replays;
- every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; frozen-turn bursts classified and key outliers listed;
- death bundles reproduced.
Report per arm and per class, from every game's messages:
- deaths and causes, final level, deepest level; paired rescued and newly killed against ctl, against g2 (g2d*) and
  against r0 (r0d100);
- "Fleeing the level (recall)" notes per game and their depth; Word of Recall read in total and carried at the end;
- deaths within 500 game turns of a Recall read, and deaths within 2,000 game turns of a flight that did not read one.
18 starts per arm show direction only.
